// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// huyuan.c
inherit NPC;
//inherit F_CLEAN_UP;

void create()
{
        set_name("护院", ({
                "hu yuan",
                "yuan",
        }));

        set("gender", "男性");
        set("attitude", "friendly");

        set("age", 30);
        set("shen_type", 1);
        set("str", 17);
        set("int", 24);
        set("con", 20);
        set("dex", 22);
        set("max_qi", 3350);
        set("max_jing", 2200);
        set("neili", 1350);
        set("max_neili", 1350);
        set("jiali", 100);
        set("combat_exp", 300000);
        set("score", 100);

        set_skill("force", 80);
        set_skill("dodge", 80);
        set_skill("sword", 120);
        set_skill("parry", 100);

        create_family("梅庄", 3, "弟子");

        setup();

        carry_object("/d/city/npc/obj/cloth")->wear();
        carry_object("/d/city/npc/obj/changjian")->wield();
}

